 relay:['an unanswered acknowledgement','contracts','A correction was sent, but the receiving desk cannot show when it was understood.','The next watch found the original timestamp beside the later acknowledgement.','We kept both times. The receiving captain should not inherit an apparently tidy sequence that never happened.'],
 clinic:['a reserve-care handover','warehouse','A sealed supply shelf can be full while a tired receiving shift has no clear collection instructions.','The next care shift asked for the custodian’s record before signing the reserve list.','We made the collection instructions part of the care handover. That improves the routine without revealing anyone’s medical history.'],
