 botany:['a protected growing trial','clinic','A promising trial changed lighting and nutrients together. A better harvest has not told us which change helped.','The next growers’ meeting has separated the variables in the written plan.','We agreed to document the next trial before interpreting its result. The water budget and the collection’s consent conditions still apply.'],
